# Master UI/UX Refactoring Plan: Bab Al Khibrah Trading LLC

> **Executive Summary**: This plan provides a surgical, B2B-tailored refactoring of the *Bab Al Khibrah Trading LLC* website. It eliminates visual clutter, consolidates duplicate headers/footers, resolves layout jumping, and elevates the industrial aesthetic while **100% preserving existing brand colors (Orange `#D65A24`), core copy, routes, and business logic**.

---

## 1. Executive Guidelines & Do-Not-Touch Rules

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Strict Constraints**:
> 1. **Brand Identity**: The signature orange accent (`#D65A24` / `text-orange`) and geometric diamond logo identity MUST NOT BE CHANGED.
> 2. **Content Integrity**: About Us copy and technical steel specs must remain 100% identical. No hallucinated operational stats will be added.
> 3. **Library Usage**: Maximize existing dependencies (`framer-motion`, `lucide-react`, Tailwind CSS). Do NOT install heavy 3D canvas libraries (Three.js, PixiJS, OGL) that degrade B2B load speed.
> 4. **Do Not Touch**:
>    - Routes (`/`, `/about`, `/materials`, `/contact`, `/processing`, `/quality`)
>    - Data schemas in `src/data/catalog.ts`
>    - Component names and exported signatures

