#### 3. Our Office Section
- **Value Justification**: **ESSENTIAL FOR B2B**. Industrial buyers in UAE/GCC require proof of physical stocking yards in Sharjah (Al Saja'a Area) to verify legitimate inventory before issuing POs.
- **Refactoring Plan**:
  - Redesign from plain text list into a **2-Column Facility Showcase Card**:
