#### 4. Footer Consolidation (Orange & Black Footer)
- **Current Fault**: The page currently has an awkward split between an orange contact box and a separate black footer bar.
- **User Directive**: Merge both into ONE cohesive footer.
- **Proposed Solution**:
  - Create a single, dark industrial footer (`bg-[#0D0F12]`) featuring:
    - **Top Accent Line**: Brand orange (`#D65A24`) 2px top border.
    - **4-Column Grid**: (1) Corporate Info & Address, (2) Stocked Materials, (3) Services, (4) Quick Contact Desk + WhatsApp.
    - **Bottom Bar**: Copyright, Standards compliance (EN 10204 3.1), and legal links.
- **Final Verification Target**:
  > *ONE UNIFIED FOOTER WITH ALL RELEVANT CONTENTS EXISTING SEAMLESSLY ACROSS ALL ROUTES.*

